nc and copper levels in sickle cell anaemia and beta-thalassaemia in North Jordan</article-title><source>Ann Trop Paediatr</source><year>1995</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>291</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8687204</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>De Sanctis</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Wonke</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aetiology of growth retardation in thalassemia major</article-title><source>In Growth in thalassemia, Roma: Mediprint</source><year>1994</year><fpage>39</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tanner</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitehouse</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical longitudinal standards for height, weight, height velocity, weight velocity, and stages of puberty</article-title><source>Arch Dis Child</source><year>1976</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>170</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">952550</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>JC</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Butrimovitz</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name><name><surname>Purdy</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Direct measurement of zinc in plasma by atomic absorption spectroscopy</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><year>1979</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>1487</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">455691</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carl</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Burtis Edward</surn